# E_lab(MeV) theta_cm(deg) sigma err ; Tumino et al. EPJA 27 s01 (2006) 243, 7Li(p,alpha)4He from the 3He break-up 7Li(3He,aa)2H,
# E(3He) = 33 MeV on LiF (Rez); Trojan horse 3He = p + d, spectator d, |p_s| <= 30 MeV/c; EXFOR O1653002 (mb, E_cm, theta_cm 50-70 deg).
# The published points are penetrability-corrected (s and p waves) and normalised to direct data at E_cm = 2-3 MeV: an on-shell
# equivalent cross section, fitted here as c.m. dsigma/dOmega at 60 deg (centre of the 50-70 deg window) with a free norm.
# E_lab = E_cm (m_p + m_7Li)/m_7Li; sigma = the EXFOR mb values (arbitrary scale, free norm); err = 10 % with a 0.01 mb floor
# (the EXFOR ERR-DIG), not the published DATA-ERR of the 52 points that carry one.
